    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Seek in a Ruined Building at Night</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Game Overview \u2013 \u201cKAKURENBO: Hide and Seek\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cKAKURENBO: Hide and Seek\u201d is a <strong>first-person 3D horror adventure game</strong> illustrated in a unique <strong>2.5D hand-drawn art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young elementary school student exploring an <strong>eerie, abandoned building</strong> on the outskirts of a small Japanese town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Genre</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D horror adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light puzzle-solving elements</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the protagonist is invited by friends to turn an old, abandoned building on the edge of town into a \u201csecret base.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the friends who started the game of hide and seek <strong>never come back</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in the dark and musty ruins, you\u2019ll slowly begin to sense that something else is lurking within these halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to make it back home safely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn illustrations come to life</strong> in a distinctive 2.5D style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person perspective</strong> for an immersive and claustrophobic experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambient sounds and unsettling silence</strong> that steadily heighten the tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light puzzles</strong> suitable for newcomers to horror games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mild <strong>jump scares</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four different endings</strong> to uncover</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd52 Estimated Playtime</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 minutes to 1 hour</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcfa Distribution Policy Summary</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed for both individuals and corporations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the game name and store page URL in the description.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior permission is required.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide and Seek in a Ruined Building at Night</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Game Overview \u2013 \u201cKAKURENBO: Hide and Seek\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cKAKURENBO: Hide and Seek\u201d is a <strong>first-person 3D horror adventure game</strong> illustrated in a unique <strong>2.5D hand-drawn art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young elementary school student exploring an <strong>eerie, abandoned building</strong> on the outskirts of a small Japanese town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Genre</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D horror adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light puzzle-solving elements</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcd6 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the protagonist is invited by friends to turn an old, abandoned building on the edge of town into a \u201csecret base.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the friends who started the game of hide and seek <strong>never come back</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in the dark and musty ruins, you\u2019ll slowly begin to sense that something else is lurking within these halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to make it back home safely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-drawn illustrations come to life</strong> in a distinctive 2.5D style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person perspective</strong> for an immersive and claustrophobic experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambient sounds and unsettling silence</strong> that steadily heighten the tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light puzzles</strong> suitable for newcomers to horror games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mild <strong>jump scares</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four different endings</strong> to uncover</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd52 Estimated Playtime</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 minutes to 1 hour</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcfa Distribution Policy Summary</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming is allowed for both individuals and corporations.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include the game name and store page URL in the description.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No prior permission is required.</p></li></ul>",
